Hi

I have been tasked with integrating some R scripts into Java. I do not know R.
Unfortunately this is not as simple as feeding scripts to the Renjin engine.

I am trying to understand the type system, and I now need to learn R. Its proving to be a very difficult processes.... Anyway...

What is the recommended way to get a list, say List<Person> into Renjin, looping over this list, and finding the average age?

Just understanding and seeing how to do the above would greatly help out.

Thank you for any help.

