Thanks Rodrigo

I appreciate your help.

To ensure we are getting the same results in Renjin as we get in R, we are using some test data ( in CSV). The idea is, once in production, we can use existing java systems and get data directly from databases and services.
Unfortunately we cannot even successfully read a csv file and convert strings to dates in Renjin. I have written about this on another thread.
This, however, means we have spent time trying to understand that bug, and not on enough time on understanding how to map between to different data structures.

And even more unfortunate - it looks like we will ditch both Renjin and, as we have not found any other ways to integrate R besides RServer, we will likely be ditching R too.

But, its good to see you are using Renjin and it is working for you. And the community is certainly helpful.
So, hopefully in the future, went Renjin is a bit more mature, we will look at it again.

Thanks again.

